mp":"2009-08-05T06:56:52.000Z","full_text":"Unable to locate said beast, I wish my fellow travelers adue and head out into the night, searching for a likely spot for cab summoning.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3141150257","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:51:49 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:51:49.000Z","full_text":"Having retrieved my belongings I cast about for the yellow and black beasts of burden.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3141115646","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:48:32 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:48:32.000Z","full_text":"s/inards/undercarriage/","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3141108257","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:47:50 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:47:50.000Z","full_text":"Exhausted the travelers disembark, jostling for position to claim our wayward belongings from within the bus' inards.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3141084301","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:45:33 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:45:33.000Z","full_text":"Into the heart of the river city we dive. Our driver deftly executes a few turns and we quickly find ourselves at our destination.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3141047215","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:42:04 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:42:04.000Z","full_text":"Our bus, sounding as weary as we feel, pulls off the byways that have carried us  to our destination.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3141016134","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:39:11 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:39:11.000Z","full_text":"It's tall buildings jutting up into the sky, like the fingers of fallen giants thrust up towards heavens.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3141012389","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:38:50 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:38:50.000Z","full_text":"The lights! We can see the lights of Sacramento on the horizon!","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140956813","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:33:42 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:33:42.000Z","full_text":"Drifting through Davis, our thoughts turn towards those we've strived for so long to see. Our friends, our families. Do they think us lost?","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140929356","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:31:18 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:31:18.000Z","full_text":"Emerging from the expanse, we solemly pass by the temple of knowledge and learning that is UC Davis.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140843917","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:23:44 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:23:44.000Z","full_text":"The lights of Dixon loom on the horizon, our last bastion of humanity before the endless expanse that leads us to Davis.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140653015","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:07:24 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:07:24.000Z","full_text":"Ignoring the angry red glare of traffic lights, our courageous driver fights his way to route 80, taking a different path to our destination","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140596330","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 06:02:42 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T06:02:42.000Z","full_text":"Stopping in exotic Fairfield, we search for other marooned passengers. But alas, none are to be found. Distraught, we continue our journey.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140522919","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 05:56:46 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T05:56:46.000Z","full_text":"The grey green cabin light matches our mood as the 3 score miles before us roll by, interrupted periodicly by a jolt of uneven pavement.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140399610","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 05:46:46 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T05:46:46.000Z","full_text":"The haunting glow of our buss' headlights blaze our trail across the treacherous expanse of route 680.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140262851","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 05:36:03 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T05:36:03.000Z","full_text":"The valiant driver, the rumble of the chariot's engine, our constant companion, charted a perilous course to distant Sacramento.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3140058928","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 05:20:35 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T05:20:35.000Z","full_text":"Boarding bus to Sacramento.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3139702563","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 04:55:06 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T04:55:06.000Z","full_text":"I want this t-shirt. http://bit.ly/e1MSB","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3139538648","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 04:43:44 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T04:43:44.000Z","full_text":"Bus to Davis maybe.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3139391857","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 04:33:52 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T04:33:52.000Z","full_text":"Hmmm. They're taking a destination count. I wonder when we start drawing straws.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3138639367","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 03:46:50 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T03:46:50.000Z","full_text":"All trains on the Capital Corridor are being help @ their stops.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3138545758","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 03:41:21 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T03:41:21.000Z","full_text":"Train went back to Martinez. Sitting @ station.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"3137830837","created_at":"Wed Aug 05 03:00:40 +0000 2009","timestamp":"2009-08-05T03:00:40.000Z","full_text":"Crossing accident ahead. Sitting @ nowhere, which is somewhere